<title>UK: N. Electric appoints new president, COO.</title>
<headline>N. Electric appoints new president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Electric said on Thursday that it had appointed Greg Abel as the president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Abel is currently president and chief operating officer of CalEnergy Europe.</p>
<p>CalEnergy of the U.S. took control of Northern Electric through a hostile takeover last December.</p>
<p>The company also appointed Ken Linge, the current financial planning manager, as director of financial planning.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
